    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-82329",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-28T18:27:43.632Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-02T19:58:24.276Z",
      "description": "JFrog Artifactory contains an authentication weakness that, under default configuration, may allow an unauthenticated attacker with network access to obtain administrative privileges.",
      "severity": 9.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：JFrog Artifactory\n🔓 漏洞类型：Improper Authentication (CWE-287)\n⚠️ **已在 CISA KEV 中标记为已知被利用 — 请立即修复！**\n📝 JFrog Artifactory contains an improper authentication vulnerability that under default configuration can allow an unauthenticated attacker with network access to obtain administrative privileges. \n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://docs.jfrog.com/releases/docs/jfrog-security-advisories",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://docs.jfrog.com/releases/docs/artifactory-self-managed-releases",
          "type": "reference"
